    p Stockmapper was created to provide a snapshot of the market along with detailed quotes, news feeds and historical graphs. Stockmapper was designed and developed by Two-N, Inc. a New York based data visualization agency. It can be configured and restyled to display any collection of financial instruments so that agents may use it for special agent processes, financial planners may use it to manage client portfolios, retailers may use is to build portfolio's and institutions may use it for an viewing specific account information.

